      398.72
    ],
    "text": "My No.: UDU/2/5/2/60. Land Ministry\u2019s No.: 13/2000/FR/34.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      400.83,
      287.4,
      522.99
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice under Sub-Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude for public purpose (the conservation of Dumbara Mountain Range). Description of the land/servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      13.918607711791992
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      524.24,
      286.44,
      600.05
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land called \u201cKarawugaha Madiththa\u201d bearing an extent of about 16.2430 Hectare mentioned in P.P. Maha 6644, Supplement of the Surveyor General, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of Meemure, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Udadumbara of Kandy District, Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      601.27,
      195.48,
      657.43
    ],
    "text": "Name and address of Claimants 1. N. Amitha Nikapitiya, 164/2, Kaduwela Road, Malabe.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      331.28,
      489.72,
      444.8
    ],
    "text": "2. B. Abeykoon, No. 774/3, Millagahawaththa Road, Thalangama North, Malabe. 3. Deepthi Naranpanawa, 940 E, Uda Watta Road, Thalangama North, Malabe.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      446.24,
      542.01,
      607.99
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude on which is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorised in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat, Udadumbara, on the 20th September 2017 at 10.00 a.m. and hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 13th September 2017 nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. SUJANI R. WIJETUNGA, Divisional Secretary, Udadumbara.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613,
